# The repo enforces LF everywhere (Prettier: "endOfLine": "lf").
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks files out as
# CRLF, and the first `pnpm format` rewrites the whole tree as a phantom diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
